    <string name="tg_cred_body">Every user uses their own key, so nothing is shared. Create it once (about 2 minutes): 1) Open my.telegram.org and sign in. 2) Tap API development tools. 3) Create an application (any title, platform Android). 4) Copy the api_id number and the api_hash text and paste them below.</string>
